  unitId: 710153
  unitNumber: 7083
  description: "Coal Cauldron has been a hothead since childhood. At the age of five,
    he made his first flamethrower and gave the sons of the opposing clans\u2019
    leaders third-degree burns. His family was able to retain control of the fuel
    oil when the world changed, giving him and his gang a certain influence over
    the region."
